{"asset_key":"timeline/quest_story_14107120","episode":"timeline","category":"quest_story","story_id":"14107120","schema_version":1,"lang":"cn","texts":{"say:5:1410712001:1":{"text":"没有路啊……干脆游过去吧！","source_cn":"没有路啊……干脆游过去吧！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xCF54647A0E3BF87F","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1410712002:1":{"text":"你最好清醒一点，周围的池水全是龙蛋清，那是极为浓郁的魔力聚合体，是设计者刻意制造的防护屏障。","source_cn":"你最好清醒一点，周围的池水全是龙蛋清，那是极为浓郁的魔...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xDFCE04C7E2A6F52E","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1410712003:1":{"text":"我又感知不到魔力，怕什么！","source_cn":"我又感知不到魔力，怕什么！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x8511F15F5E1CBE07","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1410712004:1":{"text":"就算无法感知，顶多是精神不受影响，魔力依然可以影响你的肉体。","source_cn":"就算无法感知，顶多是精神不受影响，魔力依然可以影响你的肉体。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC287BCFEE9637AF3","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:9:1410712005:1":{"text":"最坏的结果是你变成怪物。那我会立刻送你与祖先们团聚。","source_cn":"最坏的结果是你变成怪物。那我会立刻送你与祖先们团聚。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x79B9ADAA6F97739B","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_tit